2. BIP-39 English word list
---------------------------

The four pairing words are taken from the BIP-39 English word list
(https://github.com/bitcoin/bips/blob/master/bip-0039/english.txt), unchanged
(2048 words, SHA-256 2f5eed53a4727b4bf8880d8f3f199efc90e58503646d9ff8eff3a2ed3b24dbda).
BIP-39 ("Mnemonic code for generating deterministic keys") states
"License: MIT".

Used in:
  src/homalawn/link/words.txt
  the phone app's assets (omalawn_words.txt, patches/0003-omalawn-link.patch)

